        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86912, Westwood Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Westwood Refrigerator Pull features a barrel middle design that makes it a great choice for traditional and transitional home decors. It is available in all of the most popular finish colors, so you'll be sure to find exactly what you need to match the other hardware in your kitchen. This easy to install refrigerator handle upgrade comes with everything you'll need to install it on a standard appliance panel. That means that this Westwood Appliance Pull can be used on any suitable kitchen appliance including the oven and the dishwasher to complete the look of your home build with elegance. Choose rom 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Westwood Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86912-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Emtek Westwood Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86912:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86913:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
